@host = http://localhost:5080

### GET tat ca
GET {{host}}/api/products

### GET theo id
GET {{host}}/api/products/1

### POST tao moi
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Webcam Full HD",
  "description": "Camera cho hoc online",
  "price": 820000,
  "quantity": 7
}

### PUT sua (thay id=4 neu san pham moi co id 4)
PUT {{host}}/api/products/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Webcam Full HD 1080p",
  "description": "Da cap nhat",
  "price": 790000,
  "quantity": 10
}

### DELETE (thay id neu can)
DELETE {{host}}/api/products/4
